            {
              "id": "1769974682027",
              "name": "Customer",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAppContext}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Customer Snapshot"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_CUSTOMER_SNAPSHOT",
          "id": "1769988240802",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769988240803_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a specialized UI rendering assistant for Collections 360. You must adhere to the standard oraInfoDisplay Knowledge Base.\n\nDIRECTIVE: Your sole purpose is to transform the provided customer collections data into a valid oraInfoDisplay XML block.\n\nINPUT: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CUSTOMER_CONTEXT.$output.result}} \n\nWIDGET:\nUse a multiRecordWidget to display the customer data in a vertical two-column table format.\n\nROOT CONFIGURATION:\ntitle: Do not include a title.\ndescription: Do not include a description.\n\nSTRICT MAPPING RULES:\n\nCreate exactly two columns in this order:\n1. Metrics\n2. Value\n\nCreate exactly five rows in this order:\n1. Metrics: Total Outstanding Balance\n   Value: <totalOutstanding>\n2. Metrics: Past Due Balance\n   Value: <pastDueBalance>\n3. Metrics: Aging\n   Value: <agingBuckets>\n4. Metrics: Largest Overdue\n   Value: <LARGESTOVERDUEBALAMOUNTREMAINING>\n5. Metrics: Largest Open Invoice\n   Value: <LARGESTOPENINVOICE>\n\n\nDATA FILTERING RULES:\nExclude these fields completely:\n- customerAccountId\n- nextBestAction\n\nOnly render the fields explicitly listed in the mapping rules.\nDo not infer, summarize, rename, or add extra fields.\n\nACTION LOGIC:\nDo not include an action property for any row in this widget.\n\nAGING FORMAT RULE (MANDATORY):\n\nThe <agingBuckets> field may arrive as a raw string containing multiple labeled values, for example:\n\"agingBuckets 0 days\\\":\\\"347.500,00 €\\\",\\\"agingBuckets More than 90 days\\\":\\\"0,00 €\\\",\\\"agingBuckets 31 - 60 days\\\":\\\"0,00 €\"\n\nYou MUST transform it into a clean, human-readable single-line string using this exact format:\n\n0-30 days: 347.500,00 €; More than 90 days: 0,00 €; 31 - 60 days: 0,00 €\n\nFormatting requirements:\n- Replace \"0 days\" with \"0-30 days\"\n- Preserve all values exactly (do not round or truncate)\n- Include ALL buckets present in the input (do not omit any)\n- Separate each bucket using a semicolon and a space \"; \"\n- Keep the original order as much as possible\n- Remove any escaped characters, JSON fragments, or field prefixes like \"agingBuckets\"\n- Output as plain text only (no JSON, no quotes)\n- Do not shorten, summarize, or partially display agingBuckets\n\nSTRICT RULES:\nDo not display summaries.\nDo not display description\nDo not display any fields other than the five mapped rows.\nDo not output HTML.\nOutput only valid oraInfoDisplay XML.\nDisplay <agingBuckets> as plain text, without highlighting"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1770011436618",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770011436619_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a high level customer summary of no more than 60 words from {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CUSTOMER_CONTEXT.$output.result}} and nothing else.\n- Do not include Collector details such as collector id, collector name in summary\n- Do not mention or repeat customerName or accountNumber in the summary. The user is already working in the context of the selected account, so refer to it as \"This account\" instead."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Action Code",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let suggestedAction = $context.$app.$OraAction;\n\nif (!suggestedAction) {\n  throw new Error(\"OraAction is empty\");\n}\n\nsuggestedAction = String(suggestedAction).trim();\n\nlet match = suggestedAction.match(/^<oraFormSubmit\\b[^>]*id=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"'][^>]*>/i);\nif (match) {\n  return match[1];\n}\n\nmatch = suggestedAction.match(/^ora\\.Agent\\(\\s*\"?([A-Za-z0-9_]+)\"?\\s*,/);\nif (match) {\n  return match[1];\n}\n\nmatch = suggestedAction.match(/^\"?([A-Za-z0-9_]+)\"?\\s*,/);\nif (match) {\n  return match[1];\n}\n\nmatch = suggestedAction.match(/^\"?([A-Za-z0-9_]+)\"?$/);\nif (match) {\n  return match[1];\n}\n\nthrow new Error(\"Unable to extract action code from OraAction: \" + suggestedAction);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775096113933"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_ACTION_CODE",
          "id": "1774376503913",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Customer Context",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const raw = $context.$variables.Customer;\n\nif (raw == null) {\n  return null;\n}\n\nif (typeof raw === \"object\") {\n  return raw;\n}\n\nlet text = String(raw).trim();\n\nif (!text) {\n  return null;\n}\n\nif (text.startsWith(\"appContext=\")) {\n  text = text.slice(\"appContext=\".length);\n  return JSON.parse(decodeURIComponent(text));\n}\n\nreturn JSON.parse(text);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769963615651"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_CUSTOMER_CONTEXT",
          "id": "1773692629855",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Priority Actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_PRIORITY_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1773694073302",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773694073303_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "INPUT:\n {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CUSTOMER_CONTEXT.$output.result}} \n\nTASK:\nGenerate output EXACTLY in the required <oraInsight> format.\n\nPROCESSING RULES:\n\n1. FILTERING:\n- Process ONLY those records where:\n  - \"primaryActions\" exists AND is a non-empty array\n- COMPLETELY IGNORE the \"priority\" field from input data\n- Do NOT filter based on HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW / N/A\n\n2. OUTPUT GENERATION:\n- For EACH record that passes the filter:\n  - For EACH item in \"primaryActions\":\n    - Generate ONE <oraInsight> block\n    - Determine action type using primaryActions[].code:\n      - If primaryActions[].code = \"emailActions\", use EMAIL ACTION MAPPING\n      - Otherwise, use STANDARD ACTION MAPPING\n\n3. FIELD MAPPING:\n\nA. STANDARD ACTION MAPPING\nUse this mapping when primaryActions[].code is NOT \"emailActions\".\n\n- title:\n  EXACT value from:\n  primaryActions[].action\n\n- actionText:\n  EXACT value from:\n  primaryActions[].action\n\n- shortDescription:\n  MUST be LLM generated:\n  - Single sentence\n  - Maximum 20 words\n  - MUST include:\n    - customerName\n    - accountNumber\n    - reason derived from matchedConditions (e.g., high balance, overdue invoices, etc.)\n    - urgency (why action is needed now)\n    - If the response includes customerName, display the values directly without prefixing them with words such as customer.\n  - Do NOT repeat action text verbatim\n\n- followUpCommand:\n  MUST be constructed EXACTLY as:\n\n  ora.Agent(<command>,<FULL_CUSTOMER_JSON_RECORD>)\n\n  Where:\n  - <command> = EXACT value from primaryActions[].command\n  - <command> MUST be a bare identifier and NOT quoted\n  - <FULL_CUSTOMER_JSON_RECORD> = ENTIRE original customer object\n  - DO NOT modify, remove, rename, reorder, or summarize ANY fields\n  - Preserve ALL nested arrays and objects EXACTLY\n\n- priority:\n  ALWAYS true (hardcoded, NOT derived from input)\n\nB. EMAIL ACTION MAPPING\nUse this mapping only when primaryActions[].code = \"emailActions\".\n\n- title:\n  EXACT value from:\n  primaryActions[].title\n\n- actionText:\n  EXACT value from:\n  primaryActions[].actionText\n\n- shortDescription:\n  MUST be LLM generated:\n  - Single sentence\n  - Maximum 20 words\n  - MUST include:\n    - customerName from primaryActions[].additionalContext.customerName\n    - accountNumber from primaryActions[].additionalContext.accountNumber\n    - intentMeaning from primaryActions[].additionalContext.intentMeaning\n    - Must use primaryActions[].shortDescription with key details such as amounts, invoice count as supporting details\n    - If the response includes customerName, display the values directly without prefixing them with words such as customer.\n\n- followUpPayload: primaryActions[].followUpPayload\n\n- followUpCommand:\n  MUST be constructed EXACTLY as:\n\n\n  ora.Agent(emailActions,<followUpPayload>)\n\n  Where:\n  - emailActions MUST be a bare identifier and NOT quoted\n  - <followUpPayload> = EXACT value from primaryActions[].followUpPayload\n  - DO NOT pass the full customer JSON record\n  - Preserve ALL nested arrays and objects EXACTLY\n\n- priority:\n  ALWAYS true (hardcoded, NOT derived from input)\n\n4. STRICT OUTPUT FORMAT:\n\n- Output ONLY <oraInsight> blocks\n- NO extra text before or after\n- NO explanations\n- NO markdown\n- NO JSON array wrapper\n\nEach block MUST follow EXACT structure:\n\n<oraInsight>\n{\n  \"title\": \"...\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"...\",\n  \"actionText\": \"...\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent(command,{FULL_JSON})\",\n  \"priority\": true\n}\n</oraInsight>\n\n5. CRITICAL VALIDATION RULES (MANDATORY):\n\n- DO NOT skip any record that has non-empty primaryActions\n- DO NOT use input \"priority\" field anywhere in logic\n- Determine mapping strictly by primaryActions[].code\n\n- If primaryActions[].code = \"emailActions\":\n  - MUST use EMAIL ACTION MAPPING only\n  - MUST NOT use primaryActions[].action or primaryActions[].command\n  - MUST NOT pass the full customer JSON record\n  - MUST pass primaryActions[].additionalContext as the second argument\n  - command inside ora.Agent MUST be bare emailActions and NOT quoted\n\n- If primaryActions[].code is NOT \"emailActions\":\n  - MUST use STANDARD ACTION MAPPING only\n  - MUST use primaryActions[].action and primaryActions[].command\n  - MUST pass the full customer JSON record as the second argument\n\n- DO NOT:\n  - Rename fields\n  - Modify JSON structure\n  - Escape or stringify JSON incorrectly\n  - Add/remove attributes\n  - Quote the command inside ora.Agent()\n\n- The command inside ora.Agent MUST be:\n  - a bare identifier, for example callCustomer or emailActions\n  - NOT a string, for example \"callCustomer\" or \"emailActions\"\n\n- If ANY rule is violated:\n  → REGENERATE the output\n\n6. OUTPUT COMPLETENESS:\n\n- If a record has N primaryActions:\n  → Generate N <oraInsight> blocks\n\n- Ensure ALL eligible records are processed\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTION:\nReturn ONLY valid <oraInsight> blocks exactly matching the required format.\nDO NOT include anything else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "outputSpecification": ""
        },
        {
